---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { CATEGORIES } from '../lib/categories';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="about">
    <header>
      <span class="eyebrow">📓 About</span>
      <h1>About this notebook</h1>
    </header>

    <p>
      I always fill only the front of a notebook. I start with a lot of energy,
      then the glow fades and I drift away. For a long time I stopped starting
      at all, and the days I wanted to look back on slowly blurred.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is my attempt to write into the back pages anyway. It may fade
      again, but looking back, the small grains still sparkle.
    </p>

    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul class="topics">
      <li><strong>Code</strong>: what I build, and what breaks along the way.</li>
      <li><strong>Knitting</strong>: slow projects, one stitch at a time.</li>
      <li><strong>Money</strong>: learning about real estate, auctions, and personal finance.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cat-row">
      {
        Object.entries(CATEGORIES).map(([key, cat]) => (
          <a class="cat-pill" href={`/blog/category/${key}/`} style={`--c:${cat.color}; --c-soft:${cat.soft}`}>
            {cat.label}
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <h2>About me</h2>
    <p>
      I'm a software developer. I write in the one hour a day I can spare, so
      posts are short and imperfect on purpose. Posts are written in English
      and Korean over time.
    </p>
    <!-- TODO: 이름/닉네임, 한두 줄 자기소개를 원하는 만큼만 추가하세요. -->

    <h2>한국어로</h2>
    <p>
      늘 공책 앞쪽만 채우던 사람의 기록장입니다. 개발, 뜨개질, 돈 공부를
      하루 한 시간씩 천천히 적어 갑니다. 오래 못 가더라도, 일단 뒷장까지
      써 보려고 해요.
    </p>

    <h2>Find me</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="https://github.com/valiantotter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub →</a>
    </p>
  </article>

  <style>
    .about {
      max-width: 42rem;
      padding: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.5vw, 2.4rem);
      margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin: 2.2rem 0 0.6rem;
    }

    p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }

    .topics {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.75;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }

    .topics strong {
      color: var(--fg);
    }

    .cat-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .cat-pill {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--c, var(--muted));
      background: var(--c-soft, var(--surface));
      padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .cat-pill:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>